Smallest safe fix (launcher only, no write, no charge, no GitHub post). In ops/hosted-autonomy-retries.ts:600, in the `rule === undefined` branch, report the protected class through the existing onDenied channel instead of skipping it silently:

      if (ciFirstPlan !== null) plans.push(ciFirstPlan);
      else if (blocker.kind === "other" && blocker.message === CONFLICT_PROTECTED_DETAIL) {
        onDenied?.({ id: record.id, repository: record.repository, reason: "owner_protected_path" });
