The retry pass then prints `retry:<id>:denied:owner_protected_path` every pass (ops/hosted-autonomy-retry-pass.ts:396), and only for records whose issue is open: the closed-issue filter runs first. The marker variant already reports `conflict_resolution_protected` this way.

