Not recommended: labelling or commenting on the issue. The launcher has no port for that today, it would add a new GitHub write, and the per-pass line already makes the gate visible.

Separately, Sentinel PRs 1057, 1060 and 1116 stay open with their issues closed, and only the owner can close them (Sentinel must not). A per-pass `owner:<id>:pr_open_issue_closed` line would make them visible the same way.

